		{
			"id":"88b0cf0f4005ae52",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"SPL GAINSTATION IN 1-8",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1500,
			"y":380,
			"width":300,
			"height":60,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"b15f20df0cd0d6be",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[SPL GainStation 1-8](https://spl.audio/wp-content/uploads/GS8-Mk2_BA_E.pdf) ![[gainstation Background Removed.png]]",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":-1500,
			"y":540,
			"width":300,
			"height":140,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"fde9c315cdd4e7de",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**001/002 <u>ON</u> when RECORDING or using HARDWARE**\n1. Mac\n2. Converters\n3. Behringer Monitoring\n4. Black Lion (Turns on the following)\n\t1. MTRX + OUTBOARD\n\t2. PREAMPS\n\t3. SPEAKERS\n\n**OFF**\n1. PREAMPS\n2. Black Lion (Leave MTRX + OUTBOARD & SPEAKERS on)\n3. Behringer Monitoring\n4. Converters\n5. Mac Shut Down",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2080,
			"y":680,
			"width":480,
			"height":460
		},
		{
			"id":"25abc3a4baaa2bbc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[Black Lion PG-2 Type F Power Conditioner](https://www.blacklionaudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Black-Lion-Audio-PG-2-Type-F-Owners-Manual.pdf) ![[blacklion.png]]",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1500,
			"y":1020,
			"width":300,
			"height":140,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"3951049cb9925e23",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**001/002 <u>ON</u> when MIXING**\n1. Mac\n2. Black Lion (Turns on the following)\n\t1. MTRX + OUTBOARD\n\t2. SPEAKERS\n\n**OFF = ON in reverse**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-2080,
			"y":1160,
			"width":480,
			"height":235
		},
